  "action": "take_evening_off",
  "words": "Phil, the tape is on the patch. Larry, the reel is yours. I’m going to sit in the dark for a while.",
  "intention": "To witness the space one last time in silence, honoring Alma’s presence without the intrusion of production, editing, or social obligation. To let the night exist as it is, before the van leaves at 8 AM.",
  "detail": "I close the notebook, leave it on the bar counter, and take a seat in the back row of the empty theater. I do not touch the microphone. I do not check my phone. I listen to the hum of the projector, which is off, and the silence of the room."
}
